{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(´^ω^｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はハッピーバレンタイン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったー！\nやばかったー！(´>∀<｀)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコくれたみんなありがとう♡\nモテたモテた(＊･ω･＊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上がもらったもの♡、\n右が作ったもの♡、\n下が材料♡！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は仲良し４人組でお泊まりして作ったんだよ～！\n途中、リハで抜けちゃったんだけどね(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子みたいなことしたヽ(^0^)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちはクッキー担当で生地作って型抜いたりしてたよ～\nクッキー大好き(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で砂糖入れるの忘れたり笑\n材料が足りなくなったりしちゃったけど笑\n(どうにかなったけどね♡)\n大丈夫だったかな(´・ω・｀)？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、まあまあ。\nてんやわんやしてたけどすっごい楽しい一日になったよ(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木メンには今日あげるからね！\nちょっと待っててね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「君の名は希望」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表題曲で、PVもほとんど公開されてます(o^^o)よ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、ほんとにいい曲。\n歌詞がもうぶわぁ( ´;⌓;` )ってなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も危うく泣きそうになっちゃったもん( ´;⌓;` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに飛鳥は泣いてた( ´;⌓;` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞けば聞くほどすきになる！\nするめ！するめ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PV見てないって方はぜひ見て欲しい。それで色々感じてみて欲しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな( ＾ω＾ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nアンダー楽曲も楽しみにしてて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに今回のPVは力作。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成されたの見たけど可愛らしくてPOPで楽しくて映像もきれいだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いままでどのアイドルもやったことないことに挑戦しております！\nすごいよ！楽しかったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか目がびっくりしてる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぎ更新するときにはもう16歳の新しいちはるかな～(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会もあるし楽しい日々が続きそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/15/1311591/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":